# SIEM Home Lab

This lab demonstrates building a home SIEM environment using Microsoft Sentinel and simulated attack data. It covers setup, data ingestion, detection engineering, and automated response workflows.

## Objectives
- Build a functional SIEM using Microsoft Sentinel
- Ingest Windows and network logs via Log Analytics
- Create custom KQL detections for common attack patterns
- Automate incident response with Logic Apps

